+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="zh-CN">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="utf-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
+  <meta name="theme-color" content="#05090e">
+  <meta name="description" content="三颗恒星，一颗行星。基于原版 SceneScript 的实时四体演算与文明观测。">
+  <title>三体 · 实时演算</title>
+  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='16' fill='%2305090e'/%3E%3Cg fill='%23d9e9ff'%3E%3Ccircle cx='32' cy='15' r='6'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='16' cy='43' r='5'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='48' cy='43' r='4'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
+  <script src="app.js" defer></script>
+</head>
+<body>
+  <canvas id="universe" aria-label="可拖动旋转的三体实时模拟"></canvas>
+  <div id="body-labels" aria-hidden="true"></div>
+  <main id="hud">
+    <header class="signature"><span class="orbit-mark">∴</span><span>三体<span class="signature-sub">REAL-TIME SIMULATION</span></span></header>
+    <div class="coordinates"><span class="live-dot"></span><span id="universe-id">UNIVERSE / 001</span><span id="seed-caption">TRISOLARIS</span></div>
+    <section id="clock-widget" class="clock-widget">
+      <div id="clock-time">00:00<span>:00</span></div><div class="clock-calendar"><span id="clock-day"></span><span id="clock-date"></span></div>
+    </section>
+    <section id="era-widget" class="side-widget era-widget">
+      <div class="eyebrow" data-zh="行星观测" data-en="PLANET OBSERVATORY">行星观测</div>
+      <div class="widget-rule"></div><h1 id="era">恒纪元</h1><p id="hydration">浸泡 · 文明正在苏醒</p>
+      <div class="temperature"><span id="temperature">—</span><span>°C</span></div>
+      <div class="temp-gauge"><i id="temperature-indicator"></i></div>
+      <div class="range-caption"><span>−270°</span><span>+1500°</span></div>
+      <div id="physics-check" hidden></div>
+    </section>
+    <section id="distance-widget" class="side-widget distance-widget">
+      <div class="eyebrow" data-zh="恒星距离" data-en="STELLAR DISTANCES">恒星距离</div><div class="widget-rule"></div>
+      <div class="distance-row"><span>α</span><div><small>ALPHA</small><div class="distance-bar"><i></i></div></div><b>—</b></div>
+      <div class="distance-row"><span>β</span><div><small>BETA</small><div class="distance-bar"><i></i></div></div><b>—</b></div>
+      <div class="distance-row"><span>γ</span><div><small>GAMMA</small><div class="distance-bar"><i></i></div></div><b>—</b></div>
+      <div class="distance-unit">1 UNIT = 10¹² m</div>
+    </section>
+    <section id="civilization-widget" class="civilization-widget"><div id="civilization-status"></div><div id="civilization-lifespan"></div><ol id="civilization-log"></ol></section>
+    <section id="ranking-widget" class="ranking-widget" hidden><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="文明存活排行" data-en="CIVILIZATION LONGEVITY">文明存活排行</div><ol id="ranking-list"></ol></section>
+    <section class="simulation-time"><div id="audio-bars" aria-hidden="true"></div><div><span id="simulation-year">0.00</span><span class="year-unit">YEARS</span></div><small id="running-caption">每一次重生，都是一次新的可能。</small></section>
+    <div id="decor" aria-hidden="true"></div>
+    <button id="restart-prompt" hidden><span data-zh="天体已逃逸" data-en="CELESTIAL ESCAPE">天体已逃逸</span><strong data-zh="重启宇宙 ↻" data-en="RESTART UNIVERSE ↻">重启宇宙 ↻</strong></button>
+  </main>
+  <div id="loading-overlay" class="loading-overlay"><div class="loading-card"><span class="eyebrow">&lt; BODY, 3 &gt;</span><h2 id="login-title">哥白尼</h2><p id="login-password">* * * * * * * *</p><div class="loading-line"></div><p id="loading-text">引力构建中 / INITIALIZING UNIVERSE</p><button id="enter-universe">进入宇宙 / ENTER</button></div></div>
+  <div id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
+  <button id="settings-toggle" class="settings-toggle" title="设置 / Settings" aria-label="打开设置" aria-controls="settings-panel" aria-expanded="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="m9.5 3-.7 2.5-2.2 1.3-2.5-.6-2.5 4.4 1.8 1.9v2.5l-1.8 1.9 2.5 4.3 2.5-.5 2.2 1.3.7 2.4h5l.7-2.4 2.2-1.3 2.5.5 2.5-4.3-1.8-1.9v-2.5l1.8-1.9-2.5-4.4-2.5.6-2.2-1.3L14.5 3z" transform="translate(1 -2) scale(.92)"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.2"/></svg></button>
+  <aside id="settings-panel" class="settings-panel" aria-label="完整设置" aria-hidden="true" inert>
+    <header class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">UNIVERSE CONTROL</span><h2 data-zh="演算控制台" data-en="Simulation controls">演算控制台</h2></div><button id="settings-close" class="icon-button" aria-label="关闭设置">×</button></header>
+    <div class="transport"><button id="pause-button">Ⅱ 暂停</button><button id="restart-button">↻ 重启</button><button id="fullscreen-button">⛶ 全屏</button></div>
+    <label class="search-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6"/><path d="m15 15 5 5"/></svg><input id="settings-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索设置 · Search 183 controls" aria-label="搜索设置"></label>
+    <div class="panel-tabs"><button class="active" data-tab="settings">全部设置</button><button data-tab="history">文明档案</button><button data-tab="about">项目说明</button></div>
+    <div id="settings-content" class="panel-scroll"><div id="extension-controls"></div><div id="original-controls"></div><p id="search-empty" hidden>没有匹配的设置 / No matching settings</p></div>
+    <div id="history-content" class="panel-scroll" hidden><div class="section-intro"><h3>文明档案</h3><p>当前设备保存的文明死亡记录。完整参数随档案保留，方便复现与后续扩展。</p><button id="export-history">导出档案 JSON</button></div><ol id="history-list"></ol></div>
+    <div id="about-content" class="panel-scroll" hidden><article class="about-copy"><h3>三体 · 实时演算</h3><p>以你提供的 SYKM 原版 Wallpaper Engine 场景为基础。直接移植四体运动、温度、纪元与文明事件 SceneScript，复用原版贴图、星芒、字体和音乐。</p><h4>运行架构</h4><p>Three.js 渲染与后台 Web Worker 模拟独立运行；无需远程服务器，网页与 Wallpaper Engine 共用同一套内核。模拟事件可供未来通知与 Seed 排行榜订阅。</p><h4>还原边界</h4><p>默认按固定 60 Hz 复现原版节奏。修复步长设置不即时生效、恒星碰撞距离未赋值、隐藏 UI 影响计算等问题。模型使用球体和圆环重建，后处理为 Three.js 对应实现，效果尚不能声称与原版逐像素一致。</p><p>原版文明逻辑是适温诞生与灾变毁灭，没有人口或技术树。完整算法依据、参数表和兼容差异随源码提供。</p><h4>来源</h4><p>原场景：SYKM ·《三体实时演算》<br>音乐：Melodysheep · Ether<br>保留原资源来源与非商用声明。</p><p class="muted">网页版音频须主动播放；Wallpaper Engine 可直接接收系统音频。自定义背景与历史保存在当前浏览器，不会上传。</p><div id="runtime-diagnostics"></div></article></div>
+    <footer class="panel-footer"><button id="export-settings">导出种子</button><label class="file-button">导入种子<input id="import-settings" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" hidden></label><button id="reset-settings">恢复默认</button><span id="save-status">已保存到本机</span></footer>
+  </aside>
+</body>
+</html>
