ne celestial body exceeds the 'Escape Dist' (Restart Escape Distance) from the system's center of mass, you can manually reset all positions and velocities by clicking the 'Restart' text in the center of the screen. Alternatively, choose automatic reset in 'Quick Sets'.<br/>10.'Civ Seed'gameplay is offered: When you enable 'Custom' under 'Civ Seed':You can set the initial mass, spatial position, and velocity vector for each celestial body.In theory, with identical initial conditions, orbital paths will be similar within a certain timeframe.This enables sharing seed parameters. Share interesting seeds with others, use others' seeds, or compete!<br/>11.If you are unsure about specific parameters (e.g., those governing orbital mechanics), modify them with caution. If you make changes that render the system unrecognizable, reset the wallpaper to the provided 'Factory Settings'.<br/>12.Besides the default background, solid colors and custom background images are supported. Ensure your custom image is suitable for spherical UV mapping (like a skybox) to avoid seams and distortion.<br/>13.There are 192 customizable user properties. This wallpaper is a massive project, and my individual ability is limited. Errors and oversights are inevitable – please point them out and discuss! However, due to the overwhelming number of comments and messages, I cannot reply to every single one. Apologies if some are missed!", "value": ""}, "adjustmentofsolarsystem": {"index": 131, "order": 231, "text": "镜头调度 Lens Control", "type": "group", "value": ""}, "applyafterrestart": {"index": 167, "order": 267, "text": "<br/><font color='#FF2222'>重启后生效 Apply After Restart", "value": ""}, "audiobar": {"index": 205, "order": 305, "text": "<br/><font color='#33CCFF'>距离映射Menu R", "type": "bool", "value": true}, "audioresponse": {"index": 37, "order": 137, "text": "<br/><font color='#AAAAAA'>音频响应 Audio Response​​", "type": "bool", "value": true}, "audioresponse1": {"index": 218, "order": 318, "text": "音